  "_note_rating_restrictions": "Two complementary rules: (1) `low_pressure_only_digits` — material-digits physically rated for low-pressure service ONLY (CuNi/Copper/GRE/CPVC/Titanium can't sustain pressures above 150# / EEMUA 20 bar). (2) `tubing_only_digits` — when the rating is an instrument-tubing series (letter `T` = Tubing A/B/C), only these material digits are valid; carbon steel / SS plate grades / duplex etc. don't exist as tubing products. class_resolver enforces BOTH rules at /api/resolve-class and /api/compute-pms; options_routes._compute_rating_restrictions exposes them via /api/options/all so the SPA can grey out invalid (rating, material) pairs in the dropdowns up front.",
